    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0044/" title="Tall-Lemma V" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0044/" display-uri="ffi-0044" type="local">Tall-Lemma V</fr:link> — true where it matters.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0045/" title="(NS): the strict/centralizer inequality" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0045/" display-uri="ffi-0045" type="local">(NS)</fr:link> — the open inequality.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0046/" title="The Fredholm ledger" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0046/" display-uri="ffi-0046" type="local">The Fredholm ledger</fr:link> — the exact ledger.</html:li>
