    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0048/" title="The peeling induction" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0048/" display-uri="ffi-0048" type="local">The peeling induction</fr:link> — the second reduction.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0050/" title="(W): the wall conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0050/" display-uri="ffi-0050" type="local">(W)</fr:link> — refuted from <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 6]]></fr:tex>.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0052/" title="(L2): decreasing monomial germs are vacuous" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0052/" display-uri="ffi-0052" type="local">(L2)</fr:link> — proven.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0053/" title="(L3): the vacuity family" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0053/" display-uri="ffi-0053" type="local">(L3)</fr:link> — refuted, and productive.</html:li></html:ul>
          </fr:mainmatter>
